  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">寶麗來相機</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">一款適用於 Minecraft 的 Fabric 模組，新增了一種可以拍照並將照片顯示在地圖上的相機。 <br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e3Xqu_grFm0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">相機的合成配方：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/459/705/310/172/2022-05-05_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"334\" height=\"169\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您可以分別使用滑鼠滾輪和 WASD 鍵來縮放鏡頭以及調整相機角度。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用相機時按下 C 鍵即可拍照。如果您的物品欄中有一張空地圖，照片將會被複製到該地圖上。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/459/704/310/172/2022-05-05_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"333\" height=\"187\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">致謝：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Image2Map： <a href=\"https://github.com/TheEssem/Image2Map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/TheEssem/Image2Map</a><br>hannah wavelyte（相機紋理）：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/hannahwavelyte\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/hannahwavelyte</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/NYmrsnQu27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/NYmrsnQu27</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><em>試試 Kinetic Hosting，享受輕鬆無憂且經濟實惠的 Minecraft 伺服器！</em></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d587\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVfuXg1.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting Affliate Link for Cyborg Pigeon\"></a></p>",
